  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-7\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 7</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-1er\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">Pour la fixation de la Sous-partie B2, l'exercice 1994 est retenu pour l'application des articles 42, § 9, 43, § 2,:</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">a)</span>\n            <ol class=\"nested-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\">et</li>\n            </ol>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">d) et l'exercice 1995 est retenu pour l'application des articles 42, § 8,</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">3°, 43, § 1er, 1°,:</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">3°, § 2, 2 °, a), 1°,:</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">3°, b),:</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p class=\"closing-text\">2°, c) et § 3, 2°, a), b) et c), de l'arrêté ministériel du 2 août 1986.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'exercice 1995 constitue l'exercice de référence dont il est question à l'annexe 3 de l'arrêté ministériel du 2 août 1986.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
